@startuml
!theme plain
title UC-02 在庫登録 シーケンス図（設計案）
actor "在庫管理担当者" as User
participant "Webブラウザ" as Browser
participant InventoryServlet as Servlet
participant InventoryService as Service
participant "JdbcInventoryDao" as Dao
database PostgreSQL as DB
User -> Browser: 在庫名・数量を入力し登録
Browser -> Servlet: POST /inventory/create (name, quantity)
Servlet -> Service: create(name, quantity)
Service -> Service: 入力検証（FR-05）
alt 入力が不正
  Service --> Servlet: 入力エラー
  Servlet --> Browser: 入力画面＋エラー表示
else 入力が正常
  Service -> Dao: insert(name, quantity)
  Dao -> DB: INSERT INTO inventory (...)
  DB --> Dao: 新しいid
  Dao --> Service: id
  Service --> Servlet: id
  Servlet --> Browser: リダイレクト（在庫一覧）
end
@enduml
